## Model card

- **Name:** Owo 2.5 (unverified)
- **Short description:** Nothing publicly verifiable. The folder's `meta.json` claims "Owo's September 2026 proprietary LLM (1M ctx) with multimodal input and tool use; hosted via the Owo API and OpenCode Zen", priced "$0.40/$3.20 per 1M in/out (official Owo API docs)". No such vendor API, docs, or launch post could be located on the live public web; `owo.ai` (the only "Owo" domain resolving) is a human-world-models / wearables company founded Jan 2026, unrelated to LLMs.
- **Provider / access:** claimed: Owo API and OpenCode Zen (`opencode/owo-2.5`). Verified: **not present** — OpenCode Zen `/v1/models` (86 entries, checked 2026-11-13) has no owo entry; models.dev (scraped full catalog, checked 2026-11-13) has no owo provider or model; OpenRouter API (checked 2026-11-13) has no owo model.
- **Release / knowledge:** claimed September 2026; unverified.
- **IDs:** `opencode/owo-2.5` (claimed; absent from the live Zen catalog and models.dev).
- **Context window:** claimed 1,048,576 total / 256,000 max output (meta.json only — no source located).
- **Modalities:** claimed text + image in → text out, tool use (meta.json only).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-13):** claimed $0.40/$3.20 per 1M (meta.json only; "official Owo API docs" URL not found anywhere).
- **Architecture:** undisclosed; no weights, no model card, no parameters.

